          "pageContent": "University of Sargodha – E-Rozgaar Center\nDigital Skills & Freelancing Courses | Course Timings, Fee, Location & AI Automation Program\nAdmissions & General Course Information\nItem Details\nFee Rs. 9,000 per course\nLast Date to Apply 25 August 2026\nClasses Start 26 August 2026\nEligibility Intermediate results awaiting students can apply (as shown in the admissions poster)\nLocation E-Rozgaar Center, Top Floor, STC Building, University of Sargodha\nContact 048-9230830\nOnline Portal erozgaar.uos.edu.pk\nE-Rozgaar Course Timings\n# Course Timing\n1 VA & Office Automation (Basic Computer) 08:30 AM – 10:00 AM\n2 Social Media Marketing (Google, Meta & TikTok Ads) 10:00 AM – 11:30 AM\n3 WordPress / Web Development 11:30 AM – 01:00 PM\n4 AI Graphic & UI/UX Design 01:00 PM – 02:15 PM\n5 eCommerce with AI (Amazon & Shopify) 02:15 PM – 03:30 PM\n6 SEO & Content Marketing 03:30 PM – 04:45 PM\n7 AI Tools & Automation (AI) 04:45 PM – 06:00 PM\nAI Tools & Automation Mastery Program\nInstructor: Muhammad Usama Ehsan"
        },
        "pairedItem": {
          "item": 0
        }
      },
