          "pageContent": "6 SEO & Content Marketing 03:30 PM – 04:45 PM\n7 AI Tools & Automation (AI) 04:45 PM – 06:00 PM\nAI Tools & Automation Mastery Program\nInstructor: Muhammad Usama Ehsan\nInstructor Profile: AI Consultant, Software Engineer and Digital Growth Strategist with 5+ years of professional\nexperience in Artificial Intelligence, AI Automation, Digital Marketing, E-commerce, Web Development and Mobile App\nDevelopment. The poster describes him as the founder of a Software House and Digital Marketing Agency, with\nexperience delivering real-world projects across multiple industries.\nProgram Focus: Learn AI tools, automation, AI chatbots and assistants, AI agents, AI-powered development,\nmarketing automation, freelancing and portfolio building.\nCourse Outline\n1 AI Fundamentals & Future of Artificial Intelligence\n2 Prompt Engineering Mastery\n3 AI Productivity & Business Tools\n4 AI Content Creation & Branding\n5 No-Code Automation with Zapier, Make & n8n"
        },
