          "pageContent": "6 GoHighLevel CRM & Business Automation\n7 AI Chatbots & AI Assistants Development\n8 AI Agents & Intelligent Automation\n9 Vibe Coding & AI-Powered Development\n10 AI-Powered Web, App & SaaS Development\n11 AI Marketing, Lead Generation & Sales Automation\n12 Freelancing, Client Acquisition & Personal Branding\n13 Portfolio Development & Real-World AI Projects\n14 Career Launch, Remote Jobs & AI Agency Growth\nWhat You Will Gain\n• Master AI tools & automation • Build AI chatbots & AI assistants\n• Create web, app & SaaS projects • Automate business workflows\n• Start freelancing & earn online • Build a practical portfolio through real-world projects\nTiming Note: The main admissions schedule shown in the August poster lists AI Tools & Automation from 04:45 PM–06:00 PM. The\nseparate AI Automation Mastery Program poster shows a July 2026 batch with class time 03:30 PM–05:00 PM. For the current\nadmission, confirm the final AI class timing with the E-Rozgaar Center."
